      "text": "Owner decisions (2026-10-19):\n\nChart: variant 2's chart, one pane with two y axes and no legend. The axes carry their units (dB on the left, deg on the right), and each curve has its axis label's colour.\n\nCursors: T CURSOR toggles the flagged cursors C1 and C2. Their readout box sits at the bottom left with the C2-C1 row, as variant 2 drew it. The box covering part of the response is accepted.\n\nDisplay fold-out: Overlaid (the default), Magnitude only and Phase only, then Frequency axis (Log or Linear, default Log). The two-pane layout is dropped.\n\nInstruction: it says \"calibration post\".\n\nVariant 1 stays here for reference only."
